  - Wavetable synthesis algorithm
    - High-level idea:
      - Initialize a table characterizing the shape of the waveform we want to synthesize, i.e., the first period
      - Create stretched copies of this table to change frequency
      - Only have to evaluate expensive x(t) from [0, t_0)!
